      "final_text": "美国股票上涨（标普500指数 +0.7%，纳斯达克指数 +0.8%），创下历史新高，半导体、存储器及人工智能(AI)板块均跑赢大市，大型科技股表现亦佳。受生产者价格指数(PPI)数据整体偏软影响，美国国债收益率普遍下行（2年期下行5个基点至4.15%，10年期下行4个基点至4.65%，30年期下行3个基点至5.22%），但市场对9月加息的预期基本维持不变，约为34%。美元指数下跌-0.1%，黄金下跌-1.1%，布伦特原油下跌-1.7%至约$87。",
      "iterations": 2,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "U.S. equities gained (S&P 500 +0.7%, Nasdaq +0.8%) to set fresh records as semis, memory and AI all outperformed alongside big tech. Treasury yields were mostly lower (2Y -5bps to 4.15%, 10Y -4bps to 4.65%, 30Y -3bps to 5.22%) on the back of the mostly softer producer price index (PPI) print, though rate hike expectations for September remain largely unchanged at around ~34%. The dollar index fell -0.1%, gold declined -1.1% and Brent crude fell -1.7% to ~$87.",
